      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Regional Attention workflow.\n\nAttention Region nodes are chainable and define percentage boxes on the target/content image:\n- woman: x=5, y=10, width=40, height=80\n- man: x=55, y=10, width=40, height=80\n\nThe Scene Visual Reference stays global.\nWoman and Man Visual References use attention_scope=\"only in region\" and bind to their matching region_tag.\n\nLatent uses the Scene as dimensions/content with content_fit=contain and carries both tagged boxes through the target transform before Edit projects them to the Krea target token grid.\n\nGuardrail: changing content_fit to crop is allowed only when the complete declared boxes survive the crop. Any partial or complete removal raises an error rather than silently clipping a region."
      ]
    },
